GFX distributes target-specific SDL3, SDL3_ttf, and SDL3_mixer static
artifacts. Their notices and those of bundled SDL_ttf dependencies are kept in
the Licenses directory. GFX.WebView uses facilities supplied by the selected
operating system and does not distribute a browser engine.

GFX.Scene3D includes generated RGBA16F tone-mapping lookup tables derived from
the Blender OpenColorIO color-management data identified alongside the assets.
